    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31757" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκβολάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything thrown out</i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκωρία</span>
			, <i>dross,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.1.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. μήτρα,</span> Lat. <i>vulva
				ejectitia,</i> a Roman dish, <i><span class="en">
				Hipparch.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.101a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sopat.
				8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> an Egyptian
				<i>grape,</i> causing abortion, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				14.117
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
